792608366/792608367 taken as 高干渠; meridians through OSM village nodes 毛王村 14133114271 and 刘家沟村 14133114277.","note":"ENVELOPE ONLY: 13.4 km2, about 1.9x the official 7.03 km2, so the real park is a smaller irregular shape inside it. Not the 保护范围. 毛王沟村 assumed = OSM 毛王村; the ditch-as-高干渠 identification is unverified."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.87192,34.397426],[108.842884,34.391236],[108.83542,34.389244],[108.83542,34.419797],[108.835857,34.41921],[108.845736,34.421123],[108.845948,34.42145],[108.845154,34.424634],[108.845029,34.42839],[108.847093,34.430324],[108.858453,34.433324],[108.860378,34.434458],[108.867335,34.434716],[108.869772,34.433922],[108.87192,34.432803],[108.87192,34.397426]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"caihong","name_zh":"陕西彩色显像管总厂（国营第四四〇〇厂，彩虹厂）厂区","status":"[EST]","source":"OSM way 292580923 (landuse=industrial, unnamed). Supporting: 2021 学区 text (彩虹一路以西，彩虹二路及向北延线以东，彩虹厂区以北，玉泉路以南); 知乎 2019 (路西彩虹厂大门; 彩虹郦城建在彩虹老厂区原址上，占据了1100亩彩虹厂地块的一部分).","note":"Unnamed in OSM; identification by bounding roads 彩虹二路 (W) / 彩虹一路 (E), 渭阳西路 (S) and 人民西路 end (N). Area 0.73 km2 = c.1100 mu, matching the 1100亩 plot figure; the 1979 land take was 120万 m2 (中国工程院 吴祖垲自述), so housing/hospital around it were part of the wider compound. South strip along 渭阳西路 may be housing (彩虹医院 渭阳西路3号). Hand-drawn 6-vertex outline."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.667986,34.329586],[108.668998,34.326772],[108.675909,34.328356],[108.677217,34.325198],[108.662964,34.32165],[108.660966,34.327481],[108.667986,34.329586]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"mill1","name_zh":"西北国棉一厂（生产区）","status":"[EST]","source":"OSM way 333752110 (landuse=industrial, unnamed; sawtooth-roof workshops visible on imagery). Supporting: 咸阳纺织工业博物馆 民生路44号(原西北一棉生产区办公楼西侧) (本地宝); 陕西日报 2026-06-05: 咸阳市渭城区民生西路44号 … 这里曾是西北第一棉纺织厂的所在地.","note":"Block bounded by 乐育北路 (W), 民生西路 (S), 陇海铁路 (N). Industrial heritage site / museum. 0.17 km2."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.713545,34.346647],[108.717654,34.347223],[108.717718,34.346107],[108.71642,34.345726],[108.716087,34.342927],[108.715261,34.342936],[108.715304,34.342493],[108.712987,34.342688],[108.71318,34.343839],[108.712129,34.344016],[108.712483,34.345797],[108.713373,34.34593],[108.713545,34.346647]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"mill1_housing","name_zh":"西北国棉一厂（生活区，OSM 名称）","status":"[SEC]","source":"OSM way 293147996 (name=西北国棉一厂, landuse=residential). 陕棉一厂社区 人民东路41号 (本地宝).","note":"The candidate given in the brief: it is the mill's housing block south of 民生西路 (人民中路 S, 乐育北路 W), not the workshops. East of 乐育路 = 渭城区 side."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.711096,34.341923],[108.718214,34.342457],[108.718595,34.338865],[108.712008,34.338238],[108.711648,34.33845],[108.711096,34.341923]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"mill2","name_zh":"西北国棉二厂","status":"[EST]","source":"OSM way 333750116 (landuse=industrial, unnamed; sawtooth roofs on imagery) crossed by OSM road 二厂路. Supporting: 融创森屿城 七厂十字西500米北侧(原西北国棉二厂厂址) [search snippet]; 西北二棉社区 人民西路37号; 搜狐 2021 3宗位于人民西路上的西北二棉.","note":"North side of 人民西路, c.0.6 km west of the 秦皇路 crossing; may include some housing. Redeveloped as 融创森屿城. 0.36 km2."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.696054,34.341593],[108.696464,34.338858],[108.697002,34.338799],[108.697243,34.337046],[108.687149,34.336146],[108.686993,34.337525],[108.687645,34.337654],[108.687631,34.339138],[108.696054,34.341593]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"mill8","name_zh":"陕棉八厂（国营陕西第八棉纺织厂）生产区","status":"[EST]","source":"OSM way 333752112 (landuse=industrial, unnamed). THAD text (土木在线转载): 陕棉八厂总占地13.2公顷，厂址北侧为陇海铁路及郑西高铁，西侧与住宅小区紧邻，南侧为民生西路 … 西侧7.17公顷为渭城中学用地; 渭城中学 民生西路42号（原陕棉八厂生产区）; 搜狐 2021 新兴路上的陕棉八厂旁.","note":"Matches all four sides (railway N, 民生路 S, housing strip W, 新兴南路 E) and the 13.2 ha area (OSM 0.14 km2). Now 渭城中学 (W) + 融创时光宸阅 housing (E). Older 工人报 address 人民东路32号 is the 社区/office address."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.722632,34.346629],[108.723511,34.343164],[108.720255,34.342759],[108.719993,34.343795],[108.719081,34.344176],[108.718995,34.345256],[108.71966,34.345363],[108.719403,34.346984],[108.722632,34.346629]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"mill7","name_zh":"西北国棉七厂（今碧桂园秦都府一带）","status":"[EST]","source":"Block from OSM roads 秦皇路 (W), 人民中路 (S), 陇海线 (N) and 纺机路 extended to the railway (E). Supporting: 网易 关中拍客 2025: 厂址位于人民路与秦皇路交汇处的东北角 … 南临人民中路，背靠陇海铁路 … 成为碧桂园·秦都府所在地; 焦点网: 总占地约290亩.","note":"OUTER BLOCK ONLY: 0.41 km2, about 2x the 290亩 (0.19 km2) of the 碧桂园秦都府 plot, so the mill was the western part (high-rises next to 秦皇路 on imagery). East edge 纺机路 is a guess; 纺机南生活区 lies in the same block per the 纺机小学 学区 text. No OSM landuse polygon exists for it."},"geometry":{"type":"Polygon","coordinates":[[[108.697989,34.342354],[108.704918,34.344342],[108.704995,34.337455],[108.698983,34.337036],[108.697989,34.342354]]]}},{"type":"Feature","properties":{"id":"textile_park","name_zh":"咸阳新兴纺织工业园","status":"not found","source":"Point = centre of OSM way 992788221 纺织大道. 四至: 北至咸兴大道，南至新建的西宝高速，东接咸阳高新区，西至卫青路和汉武大道 … 1082.86公顷 (中国商网 via 新西部网 2015-06-04).","note":"Centre point only, c.70 m WEST of the plate edge (108.60). 咸兴大道/卫青路/汉武大道 are not in OSM, so no polygon. The park is on 兴平市 land (西吴街道/阜寨镇), east-bounded by 咸阳高新区 (秦都区 渭滨街道, whose OSM west edge is at 108.604-108.613), so at most a strip <1 km wide enters the plate."},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[108.5992,34.2893]}}]}